00:09:44.650 --> 00:09:46.630
De slatimer knippert en zwijgt dan.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:48.350
Dode brieven.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:50.230
Herleeft.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:53.190
Maar wie heeft de leiding?

00:09:53.850 --> 00:09:54.490
Governance.

